SUMMARY:Cultural Immersion Saturday: Vietnam
DESCRIPTION:Each Saturday in May highlights a unique AANHPI culture\, with community partners taking the lead on experiences\, performances\, and vendors to showcase their heritage. \n\n\n\nJoin us Saturday\, May 9\, as Vietnamese Community of Oregon brings us a full day honoring and celebrating Vietnamese culture. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMeet the Community Partner:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Vietnamese community of Oregon embodies a story of resilience\, richness\, and active participation in shaping state’s. By overcoming challenges and celebrating their heritage\, Oregonians of descent continue to enrich the local landscape in countless ways. As they forward\, their contributions will undoubtedly remain a vital part of Oregon’s identity\, ensuring that the future is as bright as their rich past. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nParking & Directions\n\n\n\nFree Lan Su Parking\n\n\n\nThere is free first come\, first served parking in our sister lot next to the garden at 424 NW Third Avenue. Additional metered parking and garages are available on surrounding streets.
URL:https://lansugarden.org/event/cultural-immersion-saturday-vietnam/
LOCATION:Lan Su Chinese Garden\, 239 NW Everett Street\, Portland\, Oregon\, 97209
CATEGORIES:AANHPI Heritage Month,Free with admission or membership
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lansugarden.org/wp-content/uploads/Web-2.webp
END:VEVENT
