SUMMARY:Mother’s Day Tea Tasting (12 PM)
DESCRIPTION:Mother’s Day Tea Tasting Ticket \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTickets\n\n\n\nTea Master\n\n\n\nParking & Directions\n\n\n\n\nSunday\, May 10  | 12:00 PM & 2:30 PM & 3:30 PM \n\n\n\nThis special experience is sure to make her feel like royalty. Join Lan Su Tea Master Hannah Ma for an intimate small-group tea tasting exploring the history and stories behind three single-origin teas from China and Taiwan\, each paired with floral-themed sweet treats. All moms in attendance will also receive a special gift bag to take home. Seats are limited\, so reserve your spot now. \n\n\n\nThis special tea tasting experience includes:  \n\n\n\n\nA private tea tasting with Lan Su Tea Master Hannah Ma \n\n\n\nThree garden-inspired sweet treats paired with the spring selections of Chinese and Taiwanese teas from Yun Shui Teahouse. \n\n\n\nA Chinese ceramic cup to take home \n\n\n\nFull-day admission to Lan Su to enjoy all of the Mother’s Day special experiences at Lan Su \n\n\n\nA special gift bag just for the moms \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGet Tickets\n\n\n\nSeating is very limited for these intimate group tastings\, so reserve your seat early. Your ticket includes garden admission on the day of your tasting. \n\n\n\n\nLan Su Members & Guests: $42.95\n\n\n\nNon-Members: $62.95\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMeet the Tea Master: Hannah Ma \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nA Portland native\, Hannah grew up drinking tea almost as often as water. Her passion was formally cultivated during her senior year of high school\, when she gained extensive experience with diverse tea blends and preparation techniques as a tea-rista at Portal Tea Company (formerly Tea Chai Té). Now a beverage enthusiast of more than six years\, Hannah is thrilled to join Lan Su’s Tea Tasting program\, where she shares science-based insights into tea’s properties and explores the rich traditions of Chinese-style tea ceremonies. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nParking & Directions\n\n\n\nFree Lan Su Parking\n\n\n\nThere is free first come\, first served parking in our sister lot next to the garden at 424 NW Third Avenue. Additional metered parking and garages are available on surrounding streets.
URL:https://lansugarden.org/event/mothers-day-tea-tasting-12-pm/
LOCATION:Lan Su Chinese Garden\, 239 NW Everett Street\, Portland\, Oregon\, 97209
CATEGORIES:Tea
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lansugarden.org/wp-content/uploads/Mothers-day-tea-tastings-hannah-ma-1200x800-1.webp
END:VEVENT
